        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Particulate environmental material which 1) is composed primarily of clay particles, with only minor proportions of other materials, 2) demonstrates plasticity when wet, and 3) is capable of hardening when dried or fired.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Do not oversimplify the particulate environmental material subclasses with design patterns or similar. The materials have properties that their components do not - write full definitions including these where possible.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EcoLexicon:clay</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
