        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>trunk vasculature</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>vascular network of torso</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>vascular network of trunk</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>vasculature of torso</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
