            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Wall of organ which has as its parts the endocardium, myocardium , epicardium, and the cardiac septum, surrounded by the pericardial sac proper and is continuous with the walls of the systemic and pulmonary arterial and venous trees.</obo:IAO_0000115>
